{
  "name": "busmap-backend",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "TDX proxy for 台北市公車即時回報地圖 App",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=24"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "node --watch --env-file=.env src/server.ts",
    "start": "node src/server.ts",
    "probe": "node --env-file=.env scripts/probe-tdx.ts",
    "diagnose": "node --env-file=.env scripts/diagnose-tdx.ts",
    "measure-quota": "node --env-file=.env scripts/measure-quota.ts",
    "test": "node --test tests/*.test.ts",
    "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.json"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^24.3.0",
    "typescript": "^5.9.2"
  },
  "comment": "刻意零**執行期**依賴——Node 24 原生支援 TypeScript 與 fetch，API 只有 4 個 GET 端點，引入框架只會拖慢 Cloud Run 冷啟動。devDependencies 僅供 `npm run typecheck`，Dockerfile 不執行 npm install，不會進到映像檔。"
}
